WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Flymake marks an error on line 2

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.640
e sends the diagnostic with the code around it

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.440
Claude answers and proposes an edit

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.710
The edit waits for permission

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:19.940
Allowing it makes the edit, and the buffer shows it

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.200
The checker runs again and finds nothing
